A weathered piece of pachment. The ink is smudged but still legible
How many fortnights must pass before I hang up my hat?
The crew is tired. [b]Chiffon[/b] is getting restless. And the sea never ends.
I know we're close. [b]The Eternal Quilt[/b] will be mine.
